    <desc>Caltrans one-way, signal-controlled traffic control at Rocky Creek Bridge, running 24/7 through 31 August 2026, with delays up to 15 minutes. You will be held here. Expect to share a single lane with released traffic - take the lane, do not let a queue pass you inside the control. Check QuickMap the morning you ride. SRC Caltrans D5 / Big Sur Chamber Highway 1 conditions, Aug 2026  [day1_sf_limekiln km 252]</desc>
