    <name>Gorda Springs Resort (cabins) + store + fuel</name>
    <desc>20.3 km south of Limekiln. Cabins, and one of only a handful of shops on this coast. Not bookable online in practice - the plan says call 805-924-1825. VERIFY the number before relying on it.  [day2_limekiln_refugio km 20]</desc>
