    <desc>A 2.5 mile undulating paved bike path along the bluff between El Capitan and Refugio - the pleasant way to start day 3 instead of the 101 shoulder. A segment has been closed for storm damage; VERIFY on site, and drop back onto 101 if it is shut.  [day3_refugio_la km 1]</desc>
