    <desc>Third of the three Gaviota-coast hike/bike parks, 2.6 km east of Refugio, and the one with the most services. Reported first-come, first-served on the middle/upper loops through 28 Jun 2026 - VERIFY current status and whether that extends to August.  [day3_refugio_la km 3]</desc>
