    <desc>US-101 between Santa Barbara and Ventura is closed to bicycles, which is why day 3 runs on city streets, county roads and the ocean-side bike paths through Carpinteria and the Rincon instead. The route obeys this: the audit shows zero bike-banned metres on this stretch.  [day3_refugio_la km 67]</desc>
